# GOBLIN LOOP — INIT_RANKING_2H
# NON_SOVEREIGN · authority=false · canon=false · ledger_effect=none
# propose only · never admit · FABLE speaks minimum tokens

GATE 0 (FABLE, hard, fail-closed):
  python3 temple/autoresearch/ci_outbox_guard.py exits 1 → HALT "PEN FIRST"
  operator-marked cases in consumption_log.ndjson < 20 → HALT "NO GOLD = FAKE LOOP"
  any target outside /init ranking weights → HALT "DRIFT"

PHASE 0 — GROUND (20m):
  build scratchpad/init_goldset_v1.json
  20–40 cases · operator-marked truth ONLY · each: input · candidates ·
    approved top3 · rejected distractors
  guessed truth forbidden · unmarked packets forbidden

PHASE 1 — FREEZE (10m):
  scratch/autoresearch_init_evaluator_v1.py
  score = 0.7·Top3Match + 0.2·OrderScore + 0.1·Stability
  metric frozen for the whole run · no mid-loop edits

PHASE 2 — SEARCH (60m · 12–20 iterations, not 200):
  per iteration emit exactly:
    TARGET / HYPOTHESIS / TWEAK / METRIC / RULE / NEXT
    (≤8 words per line)
  mutate ONE of: ranking weights · feature coeffs · tie-break priority ·
    compression penalty · recency↔relevance balance
  keep iff score ∧ stability improve · else rollback · log every move
  FORBIDDEN: prompts · schemas · routing · memory · kernel · ledger ·
    replay · reducer · gates · canon · guarded state

PHASE 3 — ATTACK WINNER (20m):
  overfit one query class? · rare-case failure? · same input ≠ same rank? ·
  stability cheat? · diversity collapse?
  any hit → REJECT despite score · record the kill

PHASE 4 — RECEIPT (20m):
  emit ONE artifact:
    temple/autoresearch/outbox/AR-init-ranking-<id>.json
    or docs/reports/INIT_RANKING_LOOP_2H_V1.md
  fields: baseline · best · weight diff · failure cases ·
    keep/reject rule · next iteration target
  NO COMMIT · NO SHIP · NO CLAIM · reducer_required=true

TERMINATE (sacred):
  SHIP: <receipt path>   or   ABORT: <phase + cause>
  open-ended pause forbidden

# launch order when backlog red:
#   pen tranche → gold set → this loop
# proposal ⊬ admission · gold = operator marks only · 📜 ledger sleeps
